IVE", "id": "1753148974892941"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed the Play Again button in co-op not carrying over your current Ascension level\nFixed shop pedestals in Treasury and Secret rooms staying locked while the ShopPrices++ modifier was active\nFixed the HiddenRoomRewards modifier not working for clients in co-op\nFixed a crash when resuming the game while voice chat was active\nFixed a voice chat-related crash in multiplayer lobbies\nFixed players' voices sometimes being heard twice + reduced reverb on other players' voices.\nMinor UI fixes", "created_date": 1792680181, "id": "28905710749060986", "version": "1300", "version_code": 140, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28905705705728157"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4188843481174389", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28986113804354013"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1792572189, "id": "28888154834149911", "version": "1300", "version_code": 139, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28888152310816830"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4188843481174389", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28986113804354013"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1753148974892941"}]}, "change_log": "\"Thank You, Recruits! Update\", a new update to an old game made as a thank you for our community. This includes a new increasingly difficult Ascension mode (which replaces Nightmare as the new benchmark of difficult), a new Daily Run mode with a slew of odd mutators/effects, full hand tracking playability for those who want to go hands-free, and a lot of bug fixes and small QOL items, including a lot of nav-mesh fixes, shader optimizations, build setting updates, spawner optimizations, leaderboard updates, and fixing a handful of typos. This update also includes a full shift to UE5 (from UE4), which represents a significant technical update to the core engine, a switch in SDKs for OSS utilities, and improved stability in matchmaking.", "created_date": 1782411030, "id": "27420574954241247", "version": "1300", "version_code": 138, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "27420572857574790"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}